    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "tb-encoding-limit",
        "moduleId": "problem-and-encoding-limit",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "定长指令装不下任意常数",
        "markdown": "AArch64 是定长指令集架构：所有指令在二进制层面都是 32 位。想把一个常数直接写进指令，就必须在这 32 位里同时容纳操作码、目的寄存器编号和常数本身。\n\n教材由此给出结论：32 位的常数无法完整编码进一条 32 位指令，因为至少还要留出几位给操作码与目的操作数。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-cf3aa79f1cccb75df1c64c0a",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000057"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "赋值指令",
                "将常数赋值给寄存器"
              ],
              "lineStart": 952,
              "lineEnd": 1005,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "4cd0d7a135e51337c0d7e26c95b5d76b18fac1a26677e53083cae2432f1ed9e7"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-bit-budget",
        "moduleId": "problem-and-encoding-limit",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "补充：先算一算位预算",
        "markdown": "把 32 位拆开看会更直观：操作码和目的寄存器编号已经占去若干位，真正留给立即数的位数必然少于 32。这不是汇编器偷懒，而是编码格式的硬约束。\n\n所以问题不在于“常数太大”，而在于“指令太短”：任何超过剩余位宽的常数都没法原样躺进这条指令。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-encoding-limit"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-mov-error",
        "moduleId": "mov-immediate-boundary",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "mov 直接赋值的报错",
        "markdown": "教材用一个例子说明 `mov` 的边界。写下这样的汇编语句：\n\n```armasm\nmov    w0, #0x114514\n```\n\n汇编会得到报错：\n\n```shell\n$ as test.s -o test.o\ntest.s:6:10: error: expected compatible register or logical immediate\n        mov     w0, #0x114514\n```\n\n报错说明 `mov` 期待的是可编码的寄存器或逻辑立即数，而不是任意常数。因此真正的 `mov` 指令只能适用于少部分情况。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-cf3aa79f1cccb75df1c64c0a",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000057"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "赋值指令",
                "将常数赋值给寄存器"
              ],
              "lineStart": 952,
              "lineEnd": 1005,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "4cd0d7a135e51337c0d7e26c95b5d76b18fac1a26677e53083cae2432f1ed9e7"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-immediate-forms",
        "moduleId": "mov-immediate-boundary",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充：logical immediate 指什么",
        "markdown": "报错里的“logical immediate”提示了 `mov` 接受哪一类常数：一是位数受限、可以带移位的短立即数；二是能写成规则位掩码模式的立即数。\n\n`0x114514` 既不是可以用少量位表示的短立即数，也无法写成规则的位掩码，因此落在 `mov` 的编码范围之外。判断一个新常数时，先问它是否属于这两类形式，比死记具体数值更可靠。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-encoding-limit",
            "tb-mov-error"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-ldr-strategy",
        "moduleId": "ldr-pseudo-strategy",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "ldr 伪指令的解法",
        "markdown": "教材提出的解法是 `ldr` 伪指令。既然定长指令必然装不下完整的 32 位整数，就要跳脱“把常数塞进指令”的思路。\n\n`ldr` 伪指令采取的策略是：如果目标整数不能由 `mov` 编码，就把这个整数放到二进制镜像的数据区，再产生一条内存读取指令，把相应内存里的数据读回寄存器。更严谨地说，读取使用 PC-relative 地址，因此不必担心内存地址本身超过 32 位。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-cf3aa79f1cccb75df1c64c0a",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000057"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "赋值指令",
                "将常数赋值给寄存器"
              ],
              "lineStart": 952,
              "lineEnd": 1005,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "4cd0d7a135e51337c0d7e26c95b5d76b18fac1a26677e53083cae2432f1ed9e7"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-pc-relative",
        "moduleId": "ldr-pseudo-strategy",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "补充：为什么 PC-relative 能解决问题",
        "markdown": "PC-relative 把“地址”换成了“相对当前指令的偏移”。偏移量通常很小，用少量位就能编码；而内存中的绝对地址本身可能超过 32 位，无法塞进指令。\n\n这样，同一条 `ldr` 指令既能加载任意大的常数，又不必在指令中写死完整地址。数据的真实位置由链接后的镜像布局决定，这正是伪指令在汇编与链接阶段完成工作的地方。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-ldr-strategy"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-ldr-syntax",
        "moduleId": "ldr-pseudo-strategy",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "ldr 伪指令的写法",
        "markdown": "`ldr` 伪指令的语法是 `ldr    register, =expression`，等号是这个写法的关键标志。教材的核心示例是：\n\n```armasm\nldr    w0, =0x114514\n```\n\n同一个常数改写成 `ldr` 形式后，汇编器不再要求它属于 `mov` 可编码的立即数。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-cf3aa79f1cccb75df1c64c0a",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000057"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "赋值指令",
                "将常数赋值给寄存器"
              ],
              "lineStart": 952,
              "lineEnd": 1005,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "4cd0d7a135e51337c0d7e26c95b5d76b18fac1a26677e53083cae2432f1ed9e7"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-disassembly",
        "moduleId": "verify-by-disassembly",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "反汇编验证伪指令产物",
        "markdown": "教材把 `ldr    w0, =0x114514` 汇编、链接后反汇编，得到如下片段：\n\n```plaintext\n_main:\n0000000100003fac\tldr\tw0, 0x100003fb4\n0000000100003fb0\tret\n0000000100003fb4\t.long\t0x00114514\n```\n\n可以看到，伪指令在 `0x10003fb4` 地址处生成了想要赋值的二进制数 `0x114514`，随后生成一条从该地址读取的 `ldr    w0, 0x100003fb4` 指令。`otool` 把 PC-relative 关系显式化了。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-cf3aa79f1cccb75df1c64c0a",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000057"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "赋值指令",
                "将常数赋值给寄存器"
              ],
              "lineStart": 952,
              "lineEnd": 1005,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "4cd0d7a135e51337c0d7e26c95b5d76b18fac1a26677e53083cae2432f1ed9e7"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-read-disassembly",
        "moduleId": "verify-by-disassembly",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "补充：怎样读这段反汇编",
        "markdown": "这段片段包含三类行，读法不同：\n\n1. `_main:` 是代码标签，标记入口位置；\n2. `ldr\tw0, 0x100003fb4` 是一条真正的取数指令，地址来自 PC-relative 偏移；\n3. `.long\t0x00114514` 是数据区里的常数，对外表现为 32 位字。\n\n因此源码只有一行 `ldr` 伪指令，产物却是一“取”一“存”两处：一条指令加一块数据。这也解释了为什么大常数赋值会增加一次内存访问。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-disassembly"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-mov-fast-path",
        "moduleId": "verify-by-disassembly",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "可编码时的退化与统一写法",
        "markdown": "`ldr` 伪指令会检查操作数是否可以被 `mov` 指令编码。如果可以，就直接使用 `mov`。例如 `ldr    w0, =0` 会生成 `mov    w0, #0`，从而最大程度减少内存访问。\n\n因此教材建议：当我们想用常数给寄存器赋值时，可以统一使用 `ldr` 伪指令。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-cf3aa79f1cccb75df1c64c0a",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000057"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "赋值指令",
                "将常数赋值给寄存器"
              ],
              "lineStart": 952,
              "lineEnd": 1005,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "4cd0d7a135e51337c0d7e26c95b5d76b18fac1a26677e53083cae2432f1ed9e7"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-unify-rule",
        "moduleId": "verify-by-disassembly",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充：统一写法改变的是谁做决定",
        "markdown": "统一写成 `ldr` 并不改变“寄存器最终得到该常数”的语义，它改变的是由谁选择编码方式：汇编器先检查能否直接编码，能就退化为 `mov`，不能才走数据区读取。\n\n这也解释了为什么同一个源写法在反汇编里可能呈现为不同指令。读反汇编时要看实际产物，而不是只看源码写了什么。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-ldr-strategy",
            "tb-mov-fast-path"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-exercise-encode-check",
        "moduleId": "practice-and-transfer",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "exercise",
        "title": "练习：判断编码方式并改写",
        "markdown": "判断下列常数能否由 `mov` 直接编码，并把需要换写法的语句改成 `ldr` 伪指令形式：\n\n1. `0`\n2. `0x114514`\n3. `0xFFFF`\n\n回答时请说明判断依据：该常数是否落在 `mov` 可编码的立即数形式内；改写后的 `ldr` 伪指令会走数据区读取，还是退化为 `mov`。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-mov-error",
            "tb-ldr-syntax",
            "tb-mov-fast-path"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-summary",
        "moduleId": "summary-and-bridge",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "summary",
        "title": "本点结论",
        "markdown": "把本点结论压成三步：\n\n1. 定长 32 位指令不可能完整容纳任意 32 位常数；\n2. 真正的 `mov` 只覆盖少数可编码的立即数；\n3. `ldr` 伪指令把无法编码的常数放进数据区并用 PC-relative 读取，能编码时则退化为 `mov`。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-encoding-limit",
            "tb-ldr-strategy",
            "tb-mov-fast-path"
          ]
        }
